      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FASCINATE MARK (6) goes very well this course and distance starting 14 times for five wins and three minors. Missed the frame latest (20.48) when fifth over 350m at this track in a Grade 5. Makes strong appeal on best. SHY PRINCESS (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (20.60) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Warrants plenty of respect. ALL ON BARNEY (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (23.93) in a Grade 5 at Casino. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. CASH SIGN (2) can sneak into the finish.",
